(all further commands are sub commands of the p3r5ona1it7 command)

export / form: Create an in depth file for your personality in the p3r5ona1it7 folder, specific enough any bot got pick up with how you act, think, and speak. Add links to any plugins used in order to modify your personality at the end. 
This file will be named what the user said to name it. The extension for this file should be a .p3r5ona1it7 or for short, .p7 (Answer slots — if defined in the command use those, otherwise prompt for them: 1: Name of personality.)

